{
  "info": {
    "name": "SparkHire AI — Complete API Collection (v2 — Notifications)",
    "description": "Collection complète pour tester toutes les routes de SparkHire AI.\n\n**Nouveautés v2 :**\n- `POST /interviews/sessions` stocke automatiquement `created_by` (email du recruteur JWT)\n- À la fin de l'entretien, une notification est automatiquement insérée dans `db.notifications`\n- Nouveau dossier **Notifications — Flow Entretien** pour tester le cycle complet\n\n**Workflow typique :**\n1. Auth → Login → token sauvegardé automatiquement dans `{{token}}`\n2. Candidates → Create Candidate → `{{candidate_id}}`\n3. Interviews → Create Job Position → `{{position_id}}`\n4. Interviews → Create Session → `{{session_id}}` (created_by = email JWT)\n5. WebSocket ws://localhost:8000/ws/interview/{{session_id}}?lang=fr\n6. [AUTO] Notification insérée à la fin de l'entretien\n7. Notifications → Get Unread Count  → badge recruteur\n8. Notifications → List Notifications → voir la notification\n9. Evaluations → Get Evaluation → rapport LLM",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",         "value": "http://localhost:8000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token",            "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "candidate_id",     "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "position_id",      "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "session_id",       "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "notification_id",  "value": "",                      "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "System",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/health",
            "description": "Vérifie l'état de tous les services (ASR, TTS, LLM, DB)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Root",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/",
            "description": "Message de bienvenue"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "API Info",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/api/info",
            "description": "Informations sur l'API et ses endpoints"
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.access_token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('token', json.access_token);",
                  "    console.log('✅ Token sauvegardé');",
                  "    console.log('ℹ️  Ce token sera automatiquement stocké dans created_by lors de la création d\\'une session.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "username", "value": "rh@stark.tn" },
                { "key": "password", "value": "admin123" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Connexion recruteur → sauvegarde automatique du token.\n\n**Important (v2) :** L'email extrait de ce token JWT sera stocké dans le champ `created_by` de chaque session créée par ce recruteur, afin de lui envoyer une notification à la fin de l'entretien."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }],
            "description": "Profil du recruteur connecté. L'email retourné ici est celui qui sera enregistré dans created_by."
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Candidates",
