            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.session_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', json.session_id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ session_id sauvegardé :', json.session_id);",
                  "    console.log('ℹ️  created_by =', json.created_by, '(email du recruteur connecté)');",
                  "    console.log('ℹ️  Une notification sera envoyée à cet email à la fin de l\\'entretien.');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"candidate_id\": \"{{candidate_id}}\",\n  \"job_position_id\": \"{{position_id}}\",\n  \"language\": \"fr\",\n  \"scheduled_at\": \"2026-03-20T10:00:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "**v2 — Notification automatique**\n\nCrée une session planifiée.\n\nLe backend extrait automatiquement l'email du recruteur depuis le JWT et le stocke dans le champ `created_by` de la session MongoDB.\n\nÀ la fin de l'entretien (WebSocket `interview_completed`), une notification est automatiquement insérée dans `db.notifications` pour cet email :\n```json\n{\n  \"type\": \"interview_completed\",\n  \"title\": \"Entretien Terminé\",\n  \"message\": \"<candidat> a terminé l'entretien (<n>/<total> réponses)\",\n  \"read\": false\n}\n```\n\nFenêtre d'accès : `scheduled_at` → `scheduled_at + 30 min`."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Create Session (no schedule) ★ created_by auto",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.session_id) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('session_id', json.session_id);",
                  "    console.log('✅ session_id sauvegardé :', json.session_id);",
                  "    console.log('ℹ️  created_by =', json.created_by);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/interviews/sessions",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type",  "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"candidate_id\": \"{{candidate_id}}\",\n  \"job_position_id\": \"{{position_id}}\",\n  \"language\": \"fr\"\n}"
            },
            "description": "Session sans planification — expire 30 min après création.\ncreated_by est automatiquement rempli depuis le JWT."
          }
